# CODEOWNERS - Define quem revisa cada parte do código
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Formato: <pattern> <owners>
# Owners podem ser: @username, @org/team-name, email@example.com

# Default - todos os arquivos
* @your-org/engineering

# Infraestrutura e CI/CD
.github/ @your-org/platform
docker/ @your-org/platform
Dockerfile @your-org/platform
Makefile @your-org/platform

# Documentação
docs/ @your-org/engineering
README.md @your-org/engineering

# Segurança
.github/workflows/security.yml @your-org/security
.gitleaks.toml @your-org/security

# Configuração do Claude
.claude/ @your-org/engineering
CLAUDE.md @your-org/engineering
